@startuml Follow_Sequence
actor UserA as Follower
actor UserB as Followed
participant Browser
participant AppServer
participant UserService
participant UserRepository
participant DB

Follower -> Browser: click 'Follow' on UserB profile
Browser -> AppServer: POST /user/{id}/follow
AppServer -> UserService: follow(user_id=UserB, follower_id=UserA)
UserService -> UserRepository: addFollower(UserB, UserA)
UserRepository -> DB: INSERT follower relation
DB --> UserRepository: result
UserRepository --> UserService: success
UserService -> FeedPublisher: attach FollowerObserver for UserA (optional)
UserService --> AppServer: success
AppServer --> Browser: JSON { success: true }

note right of UserService
  Follow action persists relation and (옵션) 구독자 옵저버 등록
end note

@enduml
